     "\r\n<font face=\"verdana\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">We are excited to announce a <strong>one-day online workshop&quot; <strong>Integrating Large Language Model Tools into R Workflows</strong>&quot; </strong>organised\r\n by Physalia-courses in conjunction with the 9th Scientific Conference \r\nof the National Museum of Natural Sciences (MNCN-CSIC)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Date:</strong> 25 March </span><br><strong>Course website: <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/llms-4-r-mncn-csic/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/llms-4-r-mncn-csic/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412829251000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3L1350CQ7aOJjm4fsKXSON\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/llms-4-r-mncn-csic/</a></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><strong></strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">This\r\n hands-on workshop introduces the ecosystem of LLM-based tools for R and\r\n shows how to integrate them directly into your data analysis workflows.\r\n Participants will learn to use LLMs to generate, edit, document, and \r\ntroubleshoot R code — boosting productivity, creativity, and \r\nreproducibility.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:verdana;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>By the end of the workshop, attendees will be able to:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Integrate LLM-based tools into R workflows</span></p>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Generate, edit, document, and troubleshoot R code quickly and accurately</span></p>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Clean, transform, and visualize data with LLM assistance</span></p>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Interact with model APIs from R and their preferred IDE</span></p>\r\n</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:verdana;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Best regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"> Carlo</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412829251000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1twMMplVhkIoJJ17R94M1p\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a></p></font>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>"
